						<div class="description">
							<div>
								
									<a href="/blog/why-being-an-explorer-beats-being-an-expert">
										<h2 class="title">Why Being an Explorer Beats Being an Expert</h2>
									</a>
								
								<p class="summary"></p>
							</div>

							<a href="/blog/why-being-an-explorer-beats-being-an-expert">View Post</a>
								
